&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to become the go-to destination for students across Europe to find a trusted home away from home. We make every step of the rental journey simple and seamless, so students can focus on what really matters: studying, exploring, and growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With HousingAnywhere, Kamernet, and Studapart under our roof, we’re Europe’s largest student rental platform. You’ll find us in Rotterdam, Paris, and Cergy, always guided by our four core values: Ownership, We are enablers, We are changemakers, and We are connectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support our continued growth, we are creating a new, strategic role at the heart of operational performance and customer experience. There is no Quality &amp;amp; Training activity in the Group today : you will build it from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Quality &amp;amp; Training Manager, you will create and lead the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity for the whole HousingAnywhere Group, covering the Operations teams in Cergy and Rotterdam. You define its scope, methods and tools, and you are responsible for service quality and operational practices across the Group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work closely with the managers of the Customer Support and Booking Ops teams to structure training, onboarding, quality monitoring and performance tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is based in France, with frequent travel to our Rotterdam office. English is the main working language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity : scope, operating model, priorities and roadmap,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up the tools, rituals and governance needed to run the activity at Group level,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harmonise quality and training practices between the Cergy and Rotterdam teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lay the foundations for the activity to grow as needs evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the training needs of the Ops teams, and accompany the integration process while migrating to a single operating model in 2027,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop complete training programmes covering customer service posture, tools, and day-to-day processes and procedures,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain training materials (scripts, practical guides, process sheets, e-learning content), working with the other departments like Product for new features,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a structured onboarding and support new joiners in live situations after initial training, to bridge theory and practice,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out an individual assessment at the end of onboarding (audits, call listening, double listening, tests) and provide personalised follow-up,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead group and one-to-one sessions, on-the-spot debriefs and targeted coaching on the fundamentals: call handling, request qualification, rephrasing, quality of written and spoken answers, and CRM data entry,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train teams on new procedures and tool changes as they are rolled out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; operational performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and roll out quality standards and control frameworks for each team, across the full user journey,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build structured quality reporting by individual, team and business unit, with a monthly report to managers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse interactions, indicators and recurring errors to identify root causes and drive continuous improvement plans,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Ops Project Manager to maintain the knowledge base,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of knowledge sharing and self-learning (e-learning) to reduce reliance on informal mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Voice of Customer and customer satisfaction projects by sharing pain points identified through quality monitoring,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose initiatives to align operational practices with company strategy and the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and support managers on using tools and analysing performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in training, quality management or quality monitoring of customer service or operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a quality or training activity from scratch, or a strong drive to do so,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up a quality monitoring programme (call listening, audits, calibration),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of customer service best practices and operational process management,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse spoken and written interactions and turn them into concrete recommendations,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teaching skills, structure and a results focus, with the ability to convince and motivate teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with CRM and telephony tools, e-learning content creation and performance dashboards,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and French are required. English is the main working language,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel frequently to Rotterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this opportunity?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A newly created role: you build the Group&#39;s Quality &amp;amp; Training activity from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group-wide impact across our teams in Cergy and Rotterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high level of autonomy to design tools, processes and training materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international environment, working between France and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role combining training, quality and operations, both strategic and hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position based in our Cergy office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive status with 218 workdays/year (with RTT days off).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% transport costs covered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% health insurance coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to fitness membership costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Christmas gift vouchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building events and much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read more about our France-based teams &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.welcometothejungle.com/en/companies/studapart&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧡 &lt;strong&gt;About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well-balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;With 380+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;👐 &lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are hiring for different squads. We will direct you to a specific team depending on your interests and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;This position is a permanent contract (CDI) based in Paris or remote from France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;💼 &lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the payment infrastructure of tomorrow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Design and develop the APIs and backend components that power payments for thousands of merchants and millions of consumers across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar on quality, security &amp;amp; performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Write maintainable, production-grade code that meets the highest standards of a regulated company processing billions of euros.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our technical architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Product and other tech leaders to evolve our architecture in line with growing business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own reliability end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Lead incident response and performance troubleshooting, driving long-term improvements to ensure our platform stays resilient at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧰 &lt;strong&gt;You will work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Python, Docker, React, GCP, Kubernetes, PostgreSQL, Redis, Pub/Sub, Datadog&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧩 &lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in backend engineering on large-scale systems (excluding internships and apprenticeships)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;relational databases&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— we&#39;re open to other backend languages, but Python is our core stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in French&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with a solid level of English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Methodical, with strong communication and problem-solving skills; at ease working in a cross-functional environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And it will be nice if you also&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Have experience building&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;payment or financial solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Have a track record of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;influencing product and technical decisions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Hold a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in Computer Science or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🧘 &lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-world scale&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— your code will directly power payments for millions of consumers and tens of thousands of merchants across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— you&#39;ll have genuine influence over architecture decisions, not just implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A regulated, fast-moving environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— you&#39;ll tackle the unique challenges of building robust, secure fintech infrastructure in a company that&#39;s still moving fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🤑 &lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health insurance&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;100%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport&lt;/strong&gt;: partnerships with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Gymlib&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Classpass&lt;/strong&gt;, or&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€30/month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maternity/paternity leave&lt;/strong&gt;: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD)&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€544.80/year&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;€10/day&lt;/strong&gt;, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental health:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off&lt;/strong&gt;: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Access to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;🎯 &lt;strong&gt;Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video call with your future manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take-home coding test&lt;/strong&gt;, followed by a remote feedback session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live system design interview&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to assess your practical and architectural knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A coffee chat with the squad you’ll join&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to further assess your skills and team fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;More information on the hiring process can be found in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://almapay.notion.site/Engineering-Interview-Process-Guide-cfd1c681d3234a4bacb5914b6122d2e9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Guide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
