&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;Are you passionate about data protection and security in a rapidly evolving digital landscape? At Schuberg Philis, we recognize that the world is shifting from traditional backup to data security and resilience. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;looking for a Platform Engineer – Backup &amp;amp; Recovery to strengthen our Data Management-as-a-Service (DMS) team and help us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;accelerate through this&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtle Emphasis&quot;&gt;transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Subtitle Char&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The DMS team&amp;nbsp;is responsible for&amp;nbsp;ensuring business continuity and peace of mind for&amp;nbsp;more than 20 of our&amp;nbsp;customers by delivering&amp;nbsp;highly available, secure, and robust data recovery platforms. Our shared platform is fully segregated and consumed by customer teams via a self-service model, securing critical data and guaranteeing recoverability across both private and public cloud environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;join&amp;nbsp;a dedicated,&amp;nbsp;group of&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;passioned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;data security experts&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;working within our larger Services Team.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;also&amp;nbsp;work closely&amp;nbsp;with our&amp;nbsp;sbp.cloud&amp;nbsp;team, who&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;self-built sovereign cloud solutions. Here, you will dive into complex customer environments&amp;nbsp;and support customer teams by&amp;nbsp;providing&amp;nbsp;strategic advice for&amp;nbsp;optimal&amp;nbsp;solutions, collaborate in RFIs/RFPs,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;conduct&amp;nbsp;in-depth&amp;nbsp;data management assessments.&amp;nbsp;With our plan-build-run approach, you take end-to-end ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&g